Brain OS bundles and depends on open-source software. This file lists major
runtime dependencies; see `poetry.lock` for the full transitive tree.

| Component | License (typical) | Use in Brain OS |
|:----------|:------------------|:----------------|
| Python | PSF | Runtime |
| Pydantic | MIT | Settings and schemas |
| FastAPI / Starlette / Uvicorn | MIT / BSD | Optional HTTP API |
| SQLAlchemy / asyncpg / Alembic | MIT | CRM (Postgres) |
| qdrant-client | Apache-2.0 | Vector retrieval |
| neo4j | Apache-2.0 | Knowledge graph |
| redis | MIT | Cache / streams |
| OpenAI Python SDK | MIT | LLM provider |
| Anthropic SDK | MIT | LLM provider |
| httpx | BSD-3-Clause | HTTP client |
| Typer / Click | MIT | CLI |
| MCP (Python SDK) | MIT | Cursor / Claude integration |
| mem0ai | Apache-2.0 | Long-term memory (optional) |
| Langfuse | MIT | Tracing (optional) |
| Voyage AI client | MIT | Embeddings (optional) |
| Instructor | MIT | Structured LLM outputs |

